<BaseLayout title="About Flowin | Pipes & fittings since 2013" description="Meet Flowin Pipe Pvt. Ltd., established in 2013, with uPVC, cPVC, SWR and agriculture pipes and fittings."><SiteHeader /><main id="main-content" tabindex="-1"><section class="wrap simple-hero"><p class="kicker">About Flowin</p><h1>The manufacturer<br />behind Flowin.</h1><p>Established in 2013, Flowin Pipe Pvt. Ltd. manufactures uPVC, cPVC, SWR and agricultural pipes and fittings under one brand. Our focus is dependable products for the people who supply them and the people who install them.</p></section><section class="wrap editorial-split"><figure><img src="/images/flowin-product-group-legacy.jpg" alt="Flowin product assortment with pipes and fittings" width="500" height="500" /></figure><div><p class="kicker">One manufacturer, four systems</p><h2>More of the piping range.<br />Under the Flowin name.</h2><p>For dealers, one manufacturer across four piping systems helps you serve plumbing, drainage and agricultural product enquiries. For plumbers, our pipe and fitting families cover the different systems a project calls for.</p><p>From pipe lengths to elbows, tees and couplers, explore the Flowin products you need for your next order. Choose the system first, then put together the sizes and quantities.</p><a class="text-link" href="/products/">Explore Flowin products</a></div></section><section class="about-values"><div class="wrap"><p class="kicker">Our approach to quality</p><h2>Quality starts<br />with manufacturing.</h2><p>We combine modern manufacturing practices with stringent quality control. Quality, durability and consistent performance guide our work, with a vision of lasting value for customers and partners.</p><div class="value-grid"><div><h3>Modern manufacturing</h3><p>Manufacturing practices focused on the needs of modern plumbing, water management and infrastructure.</p></div><div><h3>Stringent quality control</h3><p>Quality control is part of our commitment to products built for dependable, long-term use.</p></div><div><h3>A comprehensive range</h3><p>uPVC, cPVC, SWR and agriculture systems for residential, commercial, agricultural and industrial applications.</p></div></div></div></section><section class="catalogue-banner"><div class="wrap"><div><h2>Bring Flowin to your next order.</h2><p>Explore the pipes and fittings your customers ask for and your next project needs.</p></div><a class="solid-btn" href="/products/">Browse products</a></div></section></main><SiteFooter /></BaseLayout>
